{"vid":"7xK59PRVtSA","source":"7xK59PRVtSA.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":5,"txt":"Hey everyone, I'm Alex Driscoll. I'm"},{"t":7.1,"txt":"from Chattanooga, Tennessee and I've"},{"t":8.6,"txt":"been a future leader since"},{"t":9.7,"txt":"January of 2025."},{"t":11.1,"txt":">> I'm Dana Bush cutter. I am from Kansas"},{"t":13.4,"txt":"in the Kansas section and I am an"},{"t":15.5,"txt":"incoming future leader and will start my"},{"t":17.4,"txt":"term in 2026."},{"t":18.6,"txt":">> Hi, my name is Zach Sanders. I'm from"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"Rexburg, Idaho. I'm an incoming future"},{"t":23,"txt":"leader and I'll start in 2026."},{"t":27.5,"txt":"The future leaders program was something"},{"t":29.4,"txt":"the American Welding Society created to"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"really get young people involved uh and"},{"t":34.5,"txt":"see the other side of business other"},{"t":37,"txt":"than just at the section level. Our"},{"t":39.6,"txt":"board of directors, they've been around"},{"t":41.2,"txt":"for a long time and they want to bring"},{"t":43.7,"txt":"new young ideas into the fold. So in"},{"t":46.5,"txt":"order to create sort of a"},{"t":48,"txt":"pipeline for individuals to step into"},{"t":50.1,"txt":"that role, they've created the future"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"leaders. So we get paired up and"},{"t":53.4,"txt":"mentored with people that are currently"},{"t":55,"txt":"on the board. We get to sit in on the"},{"t":57,"txt":"board meetings and learn how"},{"t":58.9,"txt":"things worked and hopefully want to take"},{"t":60.9,"txt":"a path to continue on and sit on"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"the board as a voting member."},{"t":67.7,"txt":">> I'd say you get to rub shoulders"},{"t":69,"txt":"with literally the best in the welding"},{"t":71,"txt":"industry and learn from them and and"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"develop from them and understand their"},{"t":75.4,"txt":"path which is going to help you"},{"t":76.6,"txt":"throughout your career. know if I needed"},{"t":78.6,"txt":"a contact for a company that I wanted to"},{"t":81,"txt":"go work for potentially in the"},{"t":82.5,"txt":"future that's rubbing"},{"t":84.7,"txt":"shoulderto-shoulder with some of the"},{"t":86.4,"txt":"biggest names in the industry with from"},{"t":88.3,"txt":"some of the biggest companies in the"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"industry. This will allow me to"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"have that contact to, you know, be a"},{"t":94.2,"txt":"resource."},{"t":94.8,"txt":">> Being involved in the AWS has absolutely"},{"t":97.2,"txt":"helped me to to meet leaders of the the"},{"t":99.6,"txt":"welding industry as a whole. Um, since"},{"t":101.6,"txt":"then the networking and the people that"},{"t":103,"txt":"you meet has just been"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"incredible."},{"t":106.6,"txt":"If you're interested in pursuing the"},{"t":108.2,"txt":"future leaders program, definitely start"},{"t":110.3,"txt":"at your section level. Get familiar with"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"what AWS is about. Get involved at the"},{"t":115,"txt":"local section. See if you can move into"},{"t":117.3,"txt":"a section leadership role, but then get"},{"t":119.7,"txt":"out and network."},{"t":123,"txt":"I want to be able to make an impact"},{"t":124.5,"txt":"on those, especially those"},{"t":125.8,"txt":"ladies that are scared to try it and be"},{"t":129.8,"txt":"an ambassador for the welding industry"},{"t":131.6,"txt":"because it's an incredible,"},{"t":133.9,"txt":"incredible industry and there's so many"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"different ways that you can make your"},{"t":138.3,"txt":"impact on the world."}],"words":[{"t":5.04,"w":"Hey"},{"t":5.359,"w":"everyone,"},{"t":5.92,"w":"I'm"},{"t":6.16,"w":"Alex"},{"t":6.48,"w":"Driscoll."},{"t":6.96,"w":"I'm"},{"t":7.12,"w":"from"},{"t":7.2,"w":"Chattanooga,"},{"t":7.839,"w":"Tennessee"},{"t":8.16,"w":"and"},{"t":8.32,"w":"I've"},{"t":8.559,"w":"been"},{"t":8.639,"w":"a"},{"t":8.8,"w":"future"},{"t":9.04,"w":"leader"},{"t":9.36,"w":"since"},{"t":9.679,"w":"January"},{"t":10.08,"w":"of"},{"t":10.32,"w":"